{"effective_mode":"compact","effective_text_preview_length":200,"nodes":[{"end_index":68,"paragraph_id":"7328B55B","paragraph_index":1,"start_index":0,"text_preview":"**MiniMax H3 提示词最优写法规则**（基于官方 VIDEO_PROMPT_WRITING_GUIDE + 社区高成功率实践）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":69,"paragraph_id":"266539FB","paragraph_index":2,"start_index":69,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":133,"paragraph_id":"7E70CC7C","paragraph_index":3,"start_index":70,"text_preview":"H3 不是“关键词堆叠”模型，而是**按时间线生成音画同步视频**的模型。提示词本质是**结构化的导演脚本**，不是散文描述。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":134,"paragraph_id":"15C36E02","paragraph_index":4,"start_index":134,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":154,"paragraph_id":"7BC2942C","paragraph_index":5,"start_index":135,"text_preview":"### 1. 固定结构（必须严格遵守）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":155,"paragraph_id":"51ACA825","paragraph_index":6,"start_index":155,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":204,"paragraph_id":"20D969E6","paragraph_index":7,"start_index":156,"text_preview":"**基础模式（T2VA / I2VA / FL2VA / L2VA）——三段式，顺序不能变：**","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":205,"paragraph_id":"6BBCD4BB","paragraph_index":8,"start_index":205,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":213,"paragraph_id":"1EE242D4","paragraph_index":9,"start_index":206,"text_preview":"```text","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":223,"paragraph_id":"1788B3C5","paragraph_index":10,"start_index":214,"text_preview":"[可选对齐指令行]","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":224,"paragraph_id":"63B0F27B","paragraph_index":11,"start_index":224,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":259,"paragraph_id":"22D8B98B","paragraph_index":12,"start_index":225,"text_preview":"integrated_multimodal_description:","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":272,"paragraph_id":"680E96C9","paragraph_index":13,"start_index":260,"text_preview":"[Shot 1] ...","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":273,"paragraph_id":"25D731A8","paragraph_index":14,"start_index":273,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":293,"paragraph_id":"6B045749","paragraph_index":15,"start_index":274,"text_preview":"overall_soundscape:","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":297,"paragraph_id":"04955907","paragraph_index":16,"start_index":294,"text_preview":"...","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":298,"paragraph_id":"2BABBEF9","paragraph_index":17,"start_index":298,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":318,"paragraph_id":"438A5740","paragraph_index":18,"start_index":299,"text_preview":"non_diegetic_music:","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":334,"paragraph_id":"5FB28020","paragraph_index":19,"start_index":319,"text_preview":"N/A   （或具体配乐描述）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":338,"paragraph_id":"54F83E6E","paragraph_index":20,"start_index":335,"text_preview":"```","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":339,"paragraph_id":"33495B3C","paragraph_index":21,"start_index":339,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":363,"paragraph_id":"513602F2","paragraph_index":22,"start_index":340,"text_preview":"**全参考模式（Ref2VA）——六段式：**","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":491,"paragraph_id":"2FE6753F","paragraph_index":23,"start_index":364,"text_preview":"`subject_definitions` → `summary` → `retention_analysis` → `detailed_description` → `overall_soundscape` → `non_diegetic_music`","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":492,"paragraph_id":"2F35874B","paragraph_index":24,"start_index":492,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":496,"paragraph_id":"493E4733","paragraph_index":25,"start_index":493,"text_preview":"---","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":497,"paragraph_id":"6ED77D5A","paragraph_index":26,"start_index":497,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":513,"paragraph_id":"19CFA704","paragraph_index":27,"start_index":498,"text_preview":"### 2. 核心字段写法规则","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":514,"paragraph_id":"72CEB712","paragraph_index":28,"start_index":514,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":558,"paragraph_id":"26C7BCE3","paragraph_index":29,"start_index":515,"text_preview":"#### integrated_multimodal_description（最重要）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":594,"paragraph_id":"31A115FA","paragraph_index":30,"start_index":559,"text_preview":"这是主战场，所有**可见 + 可听（对白/同步音效）**内容都写这里。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":595,"paragraph_id":"32B75D08","paragraph_index":31,"start_index":595,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":605,"paragraph_id":"340FC066","paragraph_index":32,"start_index":596,"text_preview":"**必须遵守：**","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":642,"paragraph_id":"2AC3CEA3","paragraph_index":33,"start_index":606,"text_preview":"- **时间线思维**：按播放顺序写“发生了什么”，而不是静态画面描述。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":717,"paragraph_id":"0EBC643E","paragraph_index":34,"start_index":643,"text_preview":"- **[Shot 1] 不写时间戳**；后续镜头必须写 `[Shot 2] At 00:03.500, ...`（时间严格递增，不能超过总时长）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":762,"paragraph_id":"2B520802","paragraph_index":35,"start_index":718,"text_preview":"- **单镜优先**：5 秒左右的镜头尽量一镜到底。只有真正需要“新信息出现”时才切镜。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":790,"paragraph_id":"745638B4","paragraph_index":36,"start_index":763,"text_preview":"- **运镜三要素**：类型 + 幅度 + 速度。  ","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":949,"paragraph_id":"1CBE8381","paragraph_index":37,"start_index":791,"text_preview":"  推荐写法：`medium-amplitude slow push-in`、`small-amplitude slow truck`、`medium-amplitude slow arc`、`large-amplitude slow truck`、`medium-amplitude slow pull-out`。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":973,"paragraph_id":"656B1158","paragraph_index":38,"start_index":950,"text_preview":"- **动作写法黄金公式**（尤其战斗）：  ","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1020,"paragraph_id":"636667E5","paragraph_index":39,"start_index":974,"text_preview":"  **起始姿态 → 轨迹/接触点 → 受力证据 → 新几何（站位/重心/武器状态）**  ","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1080,"paragraph_id":"2544AF89","paragraph_index":40,"start_index":1021,"text_preview":"  例：不写“她挡了一下”，而写“她左前臂由内向外翻滚，掌根轻触他前臂外侧，顺势外送，他的拳路被带偏，右肩随之侧倾”。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1098,"paragraph_id":"33BAC822","paragraph_index":41,"start_index":1081,"text_preview":"- **对白格式**（强制）：  ","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1136,"paragraph_id":"206FF513","paragraph_index":42,"start_index":1099,"text_preview":"  `(S1)` 固定说话人编号 + `<d>[中文] 原句</d>`  ","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1155,"paragraph_id":"374DCC27","paragraph_index":43,"start_index":1137,"text_preview":"  同一角色全片用同一个编号，不换。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1209,"paragraph_id":"45364075","paragraph_index":44,"start_index":1156,"text_preview":"- **连续性锁死**：身份、服装、发型、武器状态、左右站位关系、场景材质等必须反复强调“全程保持不变”。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1342,"paragraph_id":"33A08284","paragraph_index":45,"start_index":1210,"text_preview":"- **负面约束写死**：`no text, no subtitles, no watermarks, no logos, neon signs emit only pure color glow with zero readable characters` 等。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1343,"paragraph_id":"04F9E993","paragraph_index":46,"start_index":1343,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1367,"paragraph_id":"27F96807","paragraph_index":47,"start_index":1344,"text_preview":"#### overall_soundscape","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1414,"paragraph_id":"6FAB0E58","paragraph_index":48,"start_index":1368,"text_preview":"- 只写**环境底噪 + 动作物理声 + 非语言人声**（脚步、衣料、碰撞、喘息、嘶吼等）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1441,"paragraph_id":"4B903ADC","paragraph_index":49,"start_index":1415,"text_preview":"- 对白**不要**再写一次（已经在上面字段里了）。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1476,"paragraph_id":"33BB67C6","paragraph_index":50,"start_index":1442,"text_preview":"- 写“干净、连续、音量适中”，避免“很大声”“很安静”这种模糊词。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1477,"paragraph_id":"6E05AD6E","paragraph_index":51,"start_index":1477,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1501,"paragraph_id":"4166FFEE","paragraph_index":52,"start_index":1478,"text_preview":"#### non_diegetic_music","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1515,"paragraph_id":"65CEC69B","paragraph_index":53,"start_index":1502,"text_preview":"- 角色听不到的背景配乐。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1557,"paragraph_id":"68166EC9","paragraph_index":54,"start_index":1516,"text_preview":"- 绝大多数武打/剧情镜直接写 `N/A`。需要配乐时写乐器 + 节奏 + 情绪。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1558,"paragraph_id":"3328F92D","paragraph_index":55,"start_index":1558,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1562,"paragraph_id":"14D67CAA","paragraph_index":56,"start_index":1559,"text_preview":"---","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1563,"paragraph_id":"6CED9818","paragraph_index":57,"start_index":1563,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1594,"paragraph_id":"5690178A","paragraph_index":58,"start_index":1564,"text_preview":"### 3. 模式专用对齐指令（I2VA/FL2VA 必加）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1595,"paragraph_id":"7C127E41","paragraph_index":59,"start_index":1595,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1619,"paragraph_id":"5AB82B1D","paragraph_index":60,"start_index":1596,"text_preview":"**I2VA（首帧接力，你现在用得最多）：**","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1627,"paragraph_id":"36DAA753","paragraph_index":61,"start_index":1620,"text_preview":"```text","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1737,"paragraph_id":"6AF2A930","paragraph_index":62,"start_index":1628,"text_preview":"For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1741,"paragraph_id":"16DD3BA5","paragraph_index":63,"start_index":1738,"text_preview":"```","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1755,"paragraph_id":"17F4257C","paragraph_index":64,"start_index":1742,"text_preview":"（后面空一行再写三段字段）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1756,"paragraph_id":"0FC7A9EA","paragraph_index":65,"start_index":1756,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1801,"paragraph_id":"08C9A3E7","paragraph_index":66,"start_index":1757,"text_preview":"**FL2VA（首尾帧）** 和 **L2VA** 有对应固定句式，按官方模板套用即可。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1802,"paragraph_id":"07E69B49","paragraph_index":67,"start_index":1802,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1806,"paragraph_id":"43A47A6C","paragraph_index":68,"start_index":1803,"text_preview":"---","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1807,"paragraph_id":"7AAAAE02","paragraph_index":69,"start_index":1807,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1833,"paragraph_id":"42915EFF","paragraph_index":70,"start_index":1808,"text_preview":"### 4. 战斗类提示词特别优化规则（高成功率）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1834,"paragraph_id":"30343018","paragraph_index":71,"start_index":1834,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1876,"paragraph_id":"046CDC6C","paragraph_index":72,"start_index":1835,"text_preview":"1. **一个镜头最多 1–3 个可读交换**（攻击-防御-结果）。超过就容易糊。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1930,"paragraph_id":"0F3179FB","paragraph_index":73,"start_index":1877,"text_preview":"2. **每招必须有“受力证据”**：被震退步数、脚跟拖痕、布条松散、枪杆弯曲、电弧熄灭、身体横飞距离等。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":1974,"paragraph_id":"25ACE13E","paragraph_index":74,"start_index":1931,"text_preview":"3. **禁止模糊动词**：不用“打”“挡”“闪”，改用具体肢体 + 轨迹 + 结果。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2080,"paragraph_id":"0388F2EE","paragraph_index":75,"start_index":1975,"text_preview":"4. **动作链条无停顿**：明确写 “every movement flows continuously into the next without pause, freeze or hesitation”。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2161,"paragraph_id":"73825151","paragraph_index":76,"start_index":2081,"text_preview":"5. **底线句必须写死**：涉及脸/头的动作一律加 “the fist absolutely never touches her face or skin”。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2209,"paragraph_id":"1ADFD1C7","paragraph_index":77,"start_index":2162,"text_preview":"6. **弹性/物理反馈强制可视化**：枪杆弯成弓形再弹直、布条被震松、湿地水花、霓虹反射等。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2274,"paragraph_id":"020DA7AC","paragraph_index":78,"start_index":2210,"text_preview":"7. **运镜服务动作**：横向力用 Truck，环绕看清动作细节用 Arc，压迫用 Push In，收尾用 Pull Out。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2275,"paragraph_id":"720E2C76","paragraph_index":79,"start_index":2275,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2279,"paragraph_id":"426BB886","paragraph_index":80,"start_index":2276,"text_preview":"---","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2280,"paragraph_id":"10C3BAC0","paragraph_index":81,"start_index":2280,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2296,"paragraph_id":"702F0D2F","paragraph_index":82,"start_index":2281,"text_preview":"### 5. 通用最佳实践清单","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2297,"paragraph_id":"68FB6121","paragraph_index":83,"start_index":2297,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2318,"paragraph_id":"033D92B9","paragraph_index":84,"start_index":2298,"text_preview":"| 原则 | 正确做法 | 错误做法 |","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2349,"paragraph_id":"6E8543FF","paragraph_index":85,"start_index":2319,"text_preview":"|------|----------|----------|","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2383,"paragraph_id":"21079BBA","paragraph_index":86,"start_index":2350,"text_preview":"| 描述对象 | 写“可见变化” | 写“高级、电影感、炸裂” |","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2412,"paragraph_id":"77B6E831","paragraph_index":87,"start_index":2384,"text_preview":"| 时间 | 明确分段或连续流 | 堆砌形容词无时间 |","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2448,"paragraph_id":"18E2EAD8","paragraph_index":88,"start_index":2413,"text_preview":"| 身份锁定 | 反复强调服装/发型/武器状态 | 只在开头写一次 |","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2488,"paragraph_id":"56926ABB","paragraph_index":89,"start_index":2449,"text_preview":"| 对白 | `(S1) <d>[中文]…</d>` | 直接写引号或中文 |","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2515,"paragraph_id":"38892070","paragraph_index":90,"start_index":2489,"text_preview":"| 切镜 | 只在有新信息时切 | 为了运镜而切 |","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2553,"paragraph_id":"1EA0ADDB","paragraph_index":91,"start_index":2516,"text_preview":"| 负面 | 明确写“不得出现文字/logo” | 不写或写“高质量” |","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2591,"paragraph_id":"65FD46C4","paragraph_index":92,"start_index":2554,"text_preview":"| 时长 | 按真实动作预算后取 17k+5 网格 | 随便写 5 秒 |","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2592,"paragraph_id":"3605B3F4","paragraph_index":93,"start_index":2592,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2596,"paragraph_id":"534378BD","paragraph_index":94,"start_index":2593,"text_preview":"---","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2597,"paragraph_id":"53F2B5F4","paragraph_index":95,"start_index":2597,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2618,"paragraph_id":"41C01C81","paragraph_index":96,"start_index":2598,"text_preview":"### 6. 推荐输出模板（直接复制用）","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2619,"paragraph_id":"7561F507","paragraph_index":97,"start_index":2619,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2641,"paragraph_id":"0BB442A1","paragraph_index":98,"start_index":2620,"text_preview":"**单镜 I2VA 战斗版（最常用）：**","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2649,"paragraph_id":"28FE861B","paragraph_index":99,"start_index":2642,"text_preview":"```text","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2759,"paragraph_id":"54BFD927","paragraph_index":100,"start_index":2650,"text_preview":"For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2760,"paragraph_id":"26403790","paragraph_index":101,"start_index":2760,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":2795,"paragraph_id":"7D114D3A","paragraph_index":102,"start_index":2761,"text_preview":"integrated_multimodal_description:","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3201,"paragraph_id":"21B4E1B7","paragraph_index":103,"start_index":2796,"text_preview":"[Shot 1] High-precision CG semi-realistic, ancient wuxia meets cyberpunk. [景别+初始构图+人物锁定]. [连续动作链条，用黄金公式写]. Camera performs a [幅度] [速度] [运镜类","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3202,"paragraph_id":"1BEDD8D1","paragraph_index":104,"start_index":3202,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3222,"paragraph_id":"69C3E165","paragraph_index":105,"start_index":3203,"text_preview":"overall_soundscape:","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3310,"paragraph_id":"2AD3039E","paragraph_index":106,"start_index":3223,"text_preview":"[环境底噪], [具体动作音效列表]. Only the spoken lines (if any). Clean, continuous, moderate levels.","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3311,"paragraph_id":"0BF12E07","paragraph_index":107,"start_index":3311,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3331,"paragraph_id":"5BB92FD1","paragraph_index":108,"start_index":3312,"text_preview":"non_diegetic_music:","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3335,"paragraph_id":"26A6DC50","paragraph_index":109,"start_index":3332,"text_preview":"N/A","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3339,"paragraph_id":"1A631B73","paragraph_index":110,"start_index":3336,"text_preview":"```","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3340,"paragraph_id":"7596B7C6","paragraph_index":111,"start_index":3340,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3344,"paragraph_id":"7D24D3A9","paragraph_index":112,"start_index":3341,"text_preview":"---","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3345,"paragraph_id":"50E01630","paragraph_index":113,"start_index":3345,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3358,"paragraph_id":"1ECBC657","paragraph_index":114,"start_index":3346,"text_preview":"**总结一句话**：  ","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3448,"paragraph_id":"3C9C24F4","paragraph_index":115,"start_index":3359,"text_preview":"H3 最优提示词 = **严格三段/六段结构** + **时间线动作描述** + **运镜三要素** + **身份连续性锁死** + **声音分层** + **明确负面约束**。","type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3449,"paragraph_id":"3EF6EB99","paragraph_index":116,"start_index":3449,"type":"Paragraph"},{"end_index":3489,"paragraph_id":"2D1918B8","paragraph_index":117,"start_index":3450,"text_preview":"把“我要什么感觉”全部翻译成“观众会看到什么变化、听到什么声音”，成功率最高。","type":"Paragraph"}],"pagination":{"has_more":false,"limit":0,"offset":0,"returned_nodes":117,"total_nodes":117},"stats":{"total_headings":0,"total_numbering_lists":0,"total_paragraphs":117,"total_tables":0},"version":0}
